        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "This is the 2005, and last, edition of the \"World Tour Soccer/This is Football\" game series.\n\nIt allows you to take an existing team and take control of them and guide them through a season by season basis. You can also create a new team, mold it in every detail, from kit to player. From there, you start off in the school league and earn league titles and promotions through the national leagues of your choice.\n\nAs well as leagues, you can take part in all the major club and international knock out tournaments, such as the Champion's League, Euro Club Cup and the World Cup.\n\nIt also now includes the ability to create a digital mask of yourself using the EyeToy play camera and apply it to a new player or any existing player of your choice.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
